description	"Imperial Worker

^2Weaponry:
- Imperial Pistol (3)
- Wrench
-- ^3Yellow ^7Style Only

^6Inventory:
- Portable Sentry Gun
- Portable Shield
- Portable E-Web Cannon

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]

The Imperial workers are engineers used by the Galactic Empire that wore hazerdous material suits as the conditions they had to work in were often biologically hazerdous. They were primarily used for operating machinery and conducting repairs. As such, they were not armored, though their toughened suits could absorb mild blast damage, and were usually armed with a pistol for personal protection."